# Build-context allowlist: exclude everything, then re-include exactly what
# docker/Dockerfile.finn reads. The dependency layers use only pyproject.toml,
# uv.lock, src/finn/resources and src/finn/resources.toml; the release stage
# also builds a wheel from the sources below.
*

!docker/
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!setup.py
!MANIFEST.in
!VERSION
!README.md
!LICENSE.txt
!src/
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
**/*.so
**/*.egg-info/
**/.git
